            </h2><p class="studio-lead">
              Not louder. Not more complicated.<br />Simply, more considered.
            </p>
          </div><div class="studio-copy">
            <p class="large-copy">Your website is often the first conversation someone has with your business. Make it a good one.</p><p>PixelFox is an independent web design studio built around a simple idea: the best digital experiences make a business feel as good online as it is in the real world.</p><p>We combine a clear commercial perspective with thoughtful design and lightweight development. Fewer distractions. Better decisions. A stronger foundation for what’s next.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Let’s get to know your business <svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" height="20" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="20"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.3"></path></svg></a>
