          </div><div class="principles-grid">
            <article>
              <span>01 / CLARITY</span><h3>Make the message matter.</h3><p>Visitors should understand who you are, what you offer, and what to do next.</p>
            </article><article>
              <span>02 / CRAFT</span><h3>The details are the design.</h3><p>Typography, rhythm, and interaction work together to create a coherent experience.</p>
            </article><article>
              <span>03 / PERFORMANCE</span><h3>Less weight. More purpose.</h3><p>Lean code, optimized imagery, and restraint. Every addition should earn its place.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
