          </p><a aria-label="Start a project" class="round-link" href="#contact"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" height="22" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="22"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.25"></path></svg></a><div aria-hidden="true" class="statement-line"></div>
        </div>
      </section><section aria-labelledby="faq-title" class="faq section-light section-space" id="questions">
        <div class="container faq-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">
              <span class="section-num">08</span>Before we begin
            </p><h2 id="faq-title">A few good<br /><em>questions.</em></h2><p>A little clarity goes a long way.</p>
          </div><div class="faq-list">
            <details class="faq-item" name="questions">
              <summary><span class="faq-number">01</span><span>Can you redesign our existing website?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-plus"></span></summary><div class="faq-answer">
                <p>Yes. We start by understanding what is working, what is getting in the way, and what your business needs next. The aim is a clearer, more useful website—not change for the sake of change.</p>
              </div>
            </details><details class="faq-item" name="questions">
              <summary><span class="faq-number">02</span><span>What kinds of businesses do you work with?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-plus"></span></summary><div class="faq-answer">
                <p>The studio is focused on ambitious businesses that value clear communication and thoughtful design, from professional services to technology and growing brands. We use an initial conversation to establish whether the project is a good fit.</p>
              </div>
            </details><details class="faq-item" name="questions">
              <summary><span class="faq-number">03</span><span>How much does a project cost?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-plus"></span></summary><div class="faq-answer">
                <p>Every project is scoped individually. The number of pages, content, integrations, and complexity all affect the work involved. We agree on a written scope and price before a project begins.</p>
              </div>
            </details><details class="faq-item" name="questions">
              <summary><span class="faq-number">04</span><span>How long does a website take?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-plus"></span></summary><div class="faq-answer">
                <p>Timing depends on the scope and the availability of content and feedback. After discovery, we agree on milestones and a realistic schedule rather than promise a one-size-fits-all turnaround.</p>
              </div>
            </details><details class="faq-item" name="questions">
              <summary><span class="faq-number">05</span><span>Will the website work on mobile?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-plus"></span></summary><div class="faq-answer">
                <p>Responsive design is part of the approach from the start. Layouts, text, navigation, and interactions are adapted and reviewed for smaller screens as well as desktop.</p>
              </div>
            </details><details class="faq-item" name="questions">
              <summary><span class="faq-number">06</span><span>Can we update the site after launch?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-plus"></span></summary><div class="faq-answer">
                <p>Yes. We discuss your editing needs during discovery. That might mean a content management system, a straightforward handover, or an ongoing support arrangement.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
